---
// PainPoints → Features — 3 core value props for MekongMind AI OS
---

<section
  id="features"
  class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-white"
  aria-labelledby="features-heading"
>
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 md:px-6 max-w-6xl">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <h2
        id="features-heading"
        class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold text-slate-900 leading-snug"
      >
        What you get out of the box
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        25+ MCP tools. Multi-provider LLMs. Usage-based billing. All in one CLI.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <!-- Feature 1: MCP Tools -->
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-200">
        <div class="mb-4 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-sky-100">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="h-6 w-6 text-sky-700" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17.25 6.75 22.5 12l-5.25 5.25m-10.5 0L1.5 12l5.25-5.25m7.5-3-4.5 16.5" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">25+ MCP Tools</h3>
        <p class="text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Memory search, task management, plan decomposition, agent orchestration, SSJ diagnostics, trading analysis, and more — all via stdio or SSE.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 2: Multi-Provider LLM -->
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-200">
        <div class="mb-4 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-sky-100">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="h-6 w-6 text-sky-700" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.813 15.904 9 18.75l-.813-2.846a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-3.09-3.09L2.25 12l2.846-.813a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 3.09-3.09L9 5.25l.813 2.846a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 3.09 3.09L15.75 12l-2.846.813a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-3.09 3.09ZM18.259 8.715 18 9.75l-.259-1.035a3.375 3.375 0 0 0-2.455-2.456L14.25 6l1.036-.259a3.375 3.375 0 0 0 2.455-2.456L18 2.25l.259 1.035a3.375 3.375 0 0 0 2.455 2.456L21.75 6l-1.036.259a3.375 3.375 0 0 0-2.455 2.456ZM16.894 20.567 16.5 21.75l-.394-1.183a2.25 2.25 0 0 0-1.423-1.423L13.5 18.75l1.183-.394a2.25 2.25 0 0 0 1.423-1.423l.394-1.183.394 1.183a2.25 2.25 0 0 0 1.423 1.423l1.183.394-1.183.394a2.25 2.25 0 0 0-1.423 1.423Z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Multi-Provider LLM</h3>
        <p class="text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          BYOK — bring your own API keys for OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, or any OpenAI-compatible endpoint. No vendor lock-in. Run locally via MLX on Apple Silicon.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 3: Polar Billing -->
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow duration-200">
        <div class="mb-4 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-sky-100">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" class="h-6 w-6 text-sky-700" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 8.25h19.5M2.25 9h19.5m-16.5 5.25h6m-6 2.25h3m-3.75 3h15a2.25 2.25 0 0 0 2.25-2.25V6.75A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 19.5 4.5h-15a2.25 2.25 0 0 0-2.25 2.25v10.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 4.5 19.5Z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Usage-Based Billing</h3>
        <p class="text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Pay only for what you use via Polar.sh. Free tier: 1K credits/month. Pro: $29/mo for 50K credits. Enterprise: unlimited, white-label, audit-ready.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
